==================== Input ====================
<p><span>a</span><script src="a.js"></script><span>b</span></p>
<div>text<script src="a.js"></script>more text that is long enough to wrap around the line width limit</div>
<div>
  <span>a</span>
  <script src="a.js"></script>
  <span>b</span>
</div>
<p>x<script>var   y=1</script>z</p>
<p><span>a</span><style>a{color:red}</style><span>b</span></p>
<div>x</div><script>a()</script><script src="b.js"></script><div>y</div>
<div>x</div><link rel="stylesheet" href="a.css"><meta name="a" content="b"><div>y</div>
<p><span>aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa</span> <script src="a.js"></script><span>bbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbbb</span></p>
<div>Price: <span>10</span> <meta itemprop="priceCurrency" content="USD">USD, and some more text that wraps the line</div>

